 </span><span begin="02:05.860" end="02:07.310">fine</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.560" end="02:14.000"><span begin="02:09.560" end="02:10.070">I'll </span><span begin="02:10.070" end="02:10.520">be </span><span begin="02:10.520" end="02:11.800">waiting </span><span begin="02:11.800" end="02:14.000">patiently</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.740" end="02:17.450"><span begin="02:14.740" end="02:15.040">Till </span><span begin="02:15.040" end="02:15.130">you </span><span begin="02:15.130" end="02:15.410">see </span><span begin="02:15.410" end="02:15.570">the </span><span begin="02:15.570" end="02:17.450">signs</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.260" end="02:24.310"><span begin="02:19.260" end="02:19.680">And </span><span begin="02:19.680" end="02:20.300">come </span><span begin="02:20.300" end="02:21.140">running </span><span begin="02:21.140" end="02:21.530">to </span><span begin="02:21.530" end="02:21.830">my </span><span begin="02:21.830" end="02:22.760">open </span><span begin="02:22.760" end="02:24.310">arms</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.340" end="02:26.820"><span begin="02:24.340" end="02:24.570">When </span><span begin="02:24.570" end="02:24.690">will </span><span begin="02:24.690" end="02:24.840">you </span><span begin="02:24.840" end="02:26.820">realize</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.950" end="02:33.780"><span begin="02:28.950" end="02:29.380">Do </span><span begin="02:29.380" end="02:29.670">we </span><span begin="02:29.670" end="02:29.930">have </span><span begin="02:29.930" end="02:30.270">to </span><span begin="02:30.270" end="02:30.820">wait </span><span begin="02:30.820" end="02:31.260">'til </span><span begin="02:31.260" end="02:31.450">our </span><span begin="02:31.450" end="02:32.060">worlds </span><span begin="02:32.060" end="02:33.780">collide</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.260" end="02:37.650"><span begin="02:34.260" end="02:34.580">Open </span><span begin="02:34.580" end="02:34.870">up </spa